  <text>
    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="3">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IIIAtr">III Atr</ref> 3</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">And lándcóp ⁊ hlafordes gifu þe he on riht age to gifanne ⁊ lahcóp ⁊ witword ⁊ gewítnes, þæt þæt stande þæt hit nan man ne awénde.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">And there shall be no interference with purchases of land, or gifts by a lord of what he has the legal right to bestow, or purchases of legal rights, or asseverations (which have been duly made) or testimonies (which have been duly given).</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Et landcopum et domini donum, quod per rectum habeat dare, et lahcopum et þitþord et geþitnessam, hoc ita permaneat, ut nullus euertat.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
